level. With unmatched connectivity, abundant leisure options, and a commitment to luxurious living, Veena Smart Homes is poised to redefine the standard of upscale living in North Mumbai. It's not just a home; it's a lifestyle crafted for those who appreciate the finer things in life.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Veena Smart Homes Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Veena Smart Homes in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 667114](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8670/BHK_Configuration/f5961c982de48fc8c367927d24ffb54b.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n393 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.17 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Veena Smart Homes in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 667115](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8670/BHK_Configuration/da1a68be9cb689654326376b317ed7ca.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n513 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.53 Cr\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Veena Smart Homes in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 667116](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8670/BHK_Configuration/0f479c1d20534e090c4b179b5eca090a.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n615 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.83 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Veena Smart Homes in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 94315](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8670/Floor%20Plan/d60520bc04b34b161b3896eba3998ef9.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Veena Smart Homes Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Exclusive Apartments.\n* Comfortable Lifestyle.\n* Mesmerizing Open Views.\n* Meticulously Planned.\n* Modern Amenities.\n* Panoramic Views.\n\n## Amenities Veena Smart Homes Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Intercom Facility\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Parking and transportation\n* Clubhouse\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Pergola With Seats\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n* Reflexology Path\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* 24/7 Security\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Veena Smart Homes Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Kandivali West](/location-review/mumbai/kandivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Kandivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Kandivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nVeena Smart Homes is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800029400, 31045, 32966](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800029400)\n\nProject: Veena Smart Homes\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Veena Smart Homes Kandivali West\n\n---\n\n* Nirmal Junior College\n* Shri T.P. Bhatia College of Science\n* KES Shroff college\n* Hebron School\n\n* BMC HospitaI\n* Saraswati Hospital\n* Paarth Hospital\n* Namaha Hospital\n\n* Infinity 2 Mall\n* Thakur Mall\n* V Mall